launchpads_list.description:
**Description**

This endpoint provides essential metrics for a list of launchpads. It offers details such as the launchpad's `id`, `slug`, `name`, `type`, `rank`, `logo`, `currentROI`, `projectsCount`, `totalRaised`. The endpoint supports sorting by the following parameters: `rank` (default), `projectsCount`, and `currentROI`. Filtering by type is also supported for targeted queries.

The `timeframe` parameter is required for the request. Available values:
- `1M` – 1 month;
- `3M` – 3 months;
- `6M` – 6 months;
- `1Y` – 1 year;
- `3Y` – 3 years;
- `All` – full data history.

**Pricing**
- Each request costs 1 credit for every 10 items. Results above 10 are rounded up (e.g., 11–20 items = 2 credits);
- An additional 1 credit is charged per applied filter;

### Access & Availability
- ✅ Included in: Advanced, Pro, Business
- ❌ Not available in: Sandbox, Basic
